{
  "note": "How Loxo pipeline stages map to the stages in the firm's client reports. Patterns are matched against the Loxo stage name, case-insensitive, first match wins. Confirm the real stage names on day one and adjust in a new version. 'No longer in process' is checked first, so a name like 'Client declined' is not read as submitted.",
